  "_comment": "Everything upload.py publishes. `src` is relative to `root` on Spiderman unless it starts with `repo:` (relative to this git checkout) or `/`. Globs are allowed. A `dst` ending in `/` keeps the source basename. `required: false` entries are skipped with a warning when absent (checkpoints that do not exist yet). Paths marked VERIFY were read from RESEARCH_CONTEXT.md and scripts/spiderman/*.sh, not listed on the server from here.",
